; Called by LinuxCNC on every abort (ESC, E-stop, program error)
; via [RS274NGC]ON_ABORT_COMMAND in the INI.
;
; SAFETY: M64 outputs are NOT reset by an abort, so release everything the
; tool change may have switched on:
;   ATC_OPEN  - automatic drawbar-open request (else drawbar re-opens after every spindle stop)
;   ATC_CLOSE - clamp-side air
;   TS        - toolsetter (left on if probing fails)
;   PROBE     - touch probe power (left on if pendant Probe-Z fails)
o<on_abort> sub
M65 P#<_ini[ATC_PINS]ATC_OPEN>
M65 P#<_ini[ATC_PINS]ATC_CLOSE>
M65 P#<_ini[OTHER_PINS]TS>
M65 P#<_ini[OTHER_PINS]PROBE>
o<on_abort> endsub
M2
